cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CycleTwin: forecasting late or absent ovulation from synthetic calendar and wearable signals"
abstract: >-
  A synthetic-data research prototype that forecasts a generated late or absent
  ovulation event from calendar history and wearable-style signals, with calibrated
  logistic models, a fail-closed safety gate and a once-only frozen evaluation.
  Not for diagnosis, contraception or conception planning.
authors:
